    "recommendations": "Ensuring the driveway and access road remain unobstructed and clearly marked could significantly improve response times given the single entry point serving multiple structures. Assigning visible address markers at the road entrance and at each structure would support responder navigation across the property. Maintaining adequate turnaround space within the vehicle parking area may assist larger emergency apparatus that cannot easily reverse along a long driveway. Awareness of the retention pond location relative to staging areas could support safe equipment placement during operations. Coordinating with local fire and EMS agencies to pre-familiarize crews with the property layout, including limited rear access to the secondary building and detached structure, may enhance overall response effectiveness."
